# Advent of Code 2020, day 1: seek the two entries that sum to 2020 and
# multiply them.
nums is Source through lines as earth as otherwise 0

part1 is
  weave hit is
    nums through seek (a gives nums through any (b gives eq 2020 (add a b)))
  ward hit
    Held a : mul a (sub 2020 a)
    Stilled : 0

part1
